    "description": "Eight datashare GETs for Exp, PAPI, and SAPI.\n\nSelect a Postman environment: Local, Sandbox, Presandbox, or Production.\nThat sets exp_base, papi_base, and sapi_base.\n\nExp: run Get Azure Token first. GETs send only Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}.\nDo not send database or supplier on Exp.\nInvoice / Order / Customer: fromDate, toDate, pageNumber.\nStock: pageNumber only.\nProduct / Route / SalesRep / Warehouse: no query params.\n\nPAPI: Authorization: Test (hardcoded, not a variable). Always send database and supplier.\nSAPI: no Authorization header. Always send database and supplier.\n\nKenya defaults: database=sat_nobleoutlook, supplier=RECKITT BENCKISER.\nDates are YYYY-MM-DD. pageNumber is 0-based.",
